{"id":"e9f730d467a652fc","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-prop-inaccessible-cond.md","title":"Inaccessible Conditions","display":"prop-inaccessible-cond — Inaccessible Conditions","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-inaccessible-cond","aliases":["58-prop-inaccessible-cond"],"display":"prop-inaccessible-cond — Inaccessible Conditions","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-inaccessible-cond"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-inaccessible-cond</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-inaccessible-cond — Inaccessible Conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e81c8573f40b6c7\" href=\"?note=2e81c8573f40b6c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md\">../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\\)</span> (strongly-inaccessible-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\\)</span> (strong-limit-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e81c8573f40b6c7\" href=\"?note=2e81c8573f40b6c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md\">../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}inaccessible-cond} \\vdash \\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\aleph_0&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}inaccessible-cond} \\vdash \\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\aleph_0&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strongly inaccessible cardinals are uncountable, regular, and strong limit; the uncountability clause prevents <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> from satisfying the displayed condition.</li>\n<li>They are the smallest large cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md","st